{"v":4,"catch":"競速之道。","desc":"《Rave Racer》是1995年由NAMCO LIMITED（現Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）發行的競速遊戲。\n憑藉動態呈現效果與更刺激的漂移操控，本作在各方面全面進化，成為超越《RIDGE RACER》系列第三部作品高期待值的暢銷之作。豐富多樣的配樂更為賽事注入澎湃能量，點燃狂熱氛圍，完美詮釋了遊戲名稱「RAVE」的精髓！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-02-26","genres":["街機","競速"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e689b426f1d351c5e6205b68df4a2a38df880f01b88e2320c3435f9ca8bb565d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6a1e867b2326a5a26d70001f0703a89db76090ec0cf79894d7796b69ff25db45.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c5529974a148028182fe8ecbda9b15b468570238eb8365d58c34e2a5dcf4f8e6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/185c953051746054afad09d0e97f5f2e58d6a97bbfc68536d9f7b6af995bf425.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0d0afa3dea5207688afe118554a10a8ba8770d5dffd1d4fa334ed5ec3e35fb7d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bbdf5b44a2fec7b142fa95c5e8aea1fc2aee6b72678b19b4e22e21583f534763.jpg"],"titleId":"0100daa026670000","dlc":[]}